{"author":{"id":"8022379585b4ab99ca8775db3eb67d33fcb256817114c28e51ccc1e9f55cdec4"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1792397969,"nonce":"xDUySyK6ZCrZJSRXArC2xAP/+zc=","title":"LSP ignores workspace changes and multi-project manifests","message":"`load_workspace_config` (`lsp/src/context.rs:37`) reads `rayzor.toml` once at start-up and only for `RayzorManifest::SingleProject`. A workspace manifest gets no class paths. It also misses:\n- `didSave`, `workspace/didChangeWatchedFiles` and `didChangeConfiguration`, so editing `rayzor.toml` or a file that isn't open needs a server restart;\n- `native-libs` and defines (`-D`, `#if` flags), so conditional code is always analysed with default defines;\n- multiple workspace folders.","files":null}]}